    "created_at": "2024-02-13T06:35:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-02-13T06:35:35Z",
    "body": "[Update 2]\r\n\r\nBurp has acknowledged the [issue](https://forum.portswigger.net/thread/montoyaapi-v2023-12-1-invalid-url-exception-in-includeinscope-api-22aee5ae) and have released a fix in their `early-adopter` release channel.\r\n\r\nAkto Burp plugin will work pre [v2023.10.1](https://portswigger.net/burp/releases/professional-community-2023-10-1) or post [v2024.1.1.1](https://portswigger.net/burp/releases/professional-community-2024-1-1-1)",
